# ⌨️ Typing Speed Studio

A premium commercial-style typing practice platform built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**.

Created as **Day 38** of the **ABTalks 60-Day AI Coding Challenge**.

---

## 🚀 Overview

Typing Speed Studio is an advanced browser-based typing application inspired by premium platforms like Monkeytype. It provides multiple typing modes, real-time analytics, adaptive practice sessions, and an elegant modern UI—all within a single self-contained HTML file.

The application is designed to help users improve typing speed, accuracy, consistency, and overall keyboard proficiency through interactive learning and detailed performance tracking.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🎯 Multiple Typing Modes

* Time Mode (15s, 30s, 60s, 120s)
* Word Count Mode
* Quote Mode
* Programming Mode
* Custom Text Mode
* Adaptive Mode
* Focus Mode
* Zen Mode

